#N canvas 50 50 1100 900 10;
#X text 20 5 Glint - icy FM bells after FRASIL's GLINT (Styves Goupil): a modulator at Ratio into a carrier \, bright at the strike and mellower as it rings (a ping \, then a softer ring). As on FRASIL \, pressure (breath) makes it louder (up to 1 + 1.5 x) and holds the ring longer while you keep blowing \; a vibrato fades in after the strike. Knobs: Ratio \, Bright \, Decay \, Ring (the level it settles at while held: 0 a bell \, up a lead);
#X obj 20 30 inlet;
#X obj 300 30 inlet;
#X obj 500 30 inlet;
#X obj 20 55 line~;
